## Components
- `src/io/web_server/` — Axum HTTP + WebSocket server (port 8443)
- `src/io/terminal/` — Interactive terminal CLI
- `src/io/unix_socket.rs` — UNIX domain socket interface
- `src/bin/installer.rs` — Setup binary

## Responsibilities
- Accept user input from multiple channels
- Publish `chat_request` / `user_input` to Bus
- Subscribe to `web_interface` for LLM output streaming

